 'ArkTS and adapter code using @kit.BasicServicesKit pasteboard. The error text comes from a source comment; concurrency limits should be confirmed on the target API. PC boundary: keyboard copy and paste is frequent and can repeat quickly.',
 'pasteboard|setData|clearData|Another setData is being processed|clipboard|promise queue|concurrent copy',
 ['media-save-and-clipboard-permissions','pasteboard-image-pixelmap-plus-encoded-record','picker-cancellation-concurrency'],
